rder-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay and Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$700</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.45.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Candy Cane</b> is a temporarily purchasable item introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log/Version_1.45.0\" title=\"Update Log/Version 1.45.0\">v1.45.0</a>. Its appearance is that of a regular candy cane, with a red bow tie on it. It is purchased at the <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">Oak Depot</a></b>, and can also be found in <b>Gift Landings</b> (unofficial name), the <b>Christmas Update</b>'s version of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_Core\" title=\"Meteor Core\">Meteor Crashes</a></b>. A green <a href=\"/wiki/Spearmint_Candy_Cane\" title=\"Spearmint Candy Cane\">spearmint</a> version of it can also be obtained.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9ad8a83f8dc258d289f3674813a1f70e\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:122px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:120px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" style=\"height:120px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20231214125403\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Candy Cane in Oak Depot\" height=\"120\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png\" data-image-key=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Candy Cane in Oak Depot\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png (485 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Candy Cane in Oak Depot\" height=\"120\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Limited in Oak Depot.png\" data-image-key=\"Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Candy Cane in Oak Depot\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ac/Limited_in_Oak_Depot.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20231214125403\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Candy Cane in Oak Depot</div></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20